From: libbox64dl
Subject: [PATCH] export openFTrace for embeddable init

Drop internal linkage so libbox64 / the Rust facade can call the upstream
BOX64_TRACE_FILE opener after LoadEnvVariables(), instead of reimplementing it.

---
 src/core.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/core.c b/src/core.c
--- a/src/core.c
+++ b/src/core.c
@@ -97,7 +97,7 @@
 int ftrace_opened = 0;
 
 
-static void openFTrace(void)
+void openFTrace(void)
 {
     const char* p = BOX64ENV(trace_file);
     #ifndef MAX_PATH
